# Pretrained weights (per D-05)
data/weights/ctrgcn/*.pth
data/weights/clip/*.pt

# Extracted features (per D-06, symlink/junction to E:\features)
data/features/

# Training results.
# Policy (Phase 13, discharges review item C7-3): `results/*` (not `results/`)
# so that `!` un-ignore rules below can re-include the thesis provenance
# sources (git cannot re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded).
# Fully-wanted paths get explicit `!` rules here. Subdirectories holding a MIX
# of wanted and unwanted files (_coral_derisk/, _tta_rerun_continual/,
# h1_recompute/, phase10_charts/, and the 128 canonical run dirs) deliberately
# get NO broad un-ignore rules: their already-tracked files stay tracked
# regardless of gitignore, new files there are added via `git add -f`
# (spec 7a permits either mechanism), and the hybrid keeps `git status` free
# of ~880 untracked TTA JSONs.
results/*
!results/results-index.csv
!results/benchmark_models.csv
!results/backbone_bench_combined.csv
!results/_analysis_2026-06-10/
!results/_analysis_2026-06-10/**
results_sweep/

